cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use sm-vcf-annotation in your research, please cite it as below.'
type: software
title: 'sm-vcf-annotation'
abstract: >-
  Snakemake workflow for annotating VCF files with snpEff, SnpSift, and
  dbNSFP. It supports local execution and SLURM clusters, scatter/gather
  processing, additional VCF annotations, and quality-control reporting.
version: 1.2.2
date-released: '2026-02-20'
